WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:01.357
After 1945,

2
00:00:01.357 --> 00:00:04.220
empires that seemed permanent fell

3
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:05.781
within decades.

4
00:00:05.781 --> 00:00:06.788
Asia first,

5
00:00:06.788 --> 00:00:08.249
then Africa.

6
00:00:08.590 --> 00:00:11.668
France lost Vietnam after Dien

7
00:00:11.668 --> 00:00:12.817
Bien Phu,

8
00:00:12.817 --> 00:00:13.804
in 1954.

9
00:00:13.804 --> 00:00:16.735
Ghana became the first sub-Saharan

10
00:00:16.735 --> 00:00:18.863
colony to win freedom,

11
00:00:18.863 --> 00:00:19.926
in 1957.

12
00:00:19.926 --> 00:00:23.438
South Africa's apartheid ended in

13
00:00:23.438 --> 00:00:24.539
1994.

14
00:00:24.882 --> 00:00:27.073
Kwame Nkrumah in Ghana,

15
00:00:27.073 --> 00:00:29.133
and Nelson Mandela in South

16
00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:30.199
Africa.

17
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:33.340
Latin America freed itself earlier,

18
00:00:33.340 --> 00:00:36.149
with leaders like Simón Bolívar.

19
00:00:36.493 --> 00:00:37.719
Your turn.

20
00:00:37.719 --> 00:00:39.309
Which country?
